Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.10.70-rt74 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.10.70 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.10-rt
  Head SHA1: a31a1e7157a179929ae1304a0056128673ea1ce4


Or to build 3.10.70-rt74 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.10.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.10.70.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.10/patch-3.10.70-rt74.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

